  "description": "The deeper Feywilds gather around a path of pale, irregular stones, with a chain of luminous pools on either side. Large blue mushrooms fill the upper-left corner, while violet crystals and clusters of oversized flowers mark the banks. A slim waterfall falls through the trees on the upper right. Golden motes are scattered beneath the dark green canopy, and reflections brighten the turquoise water even where the forest is shaded. The path narrows towards the upper distance; curled fern shapes and bright blossoms crowd its edges without turning the centre into a wall of plants.",
